#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:6
msgid ""
"XGrammar enables efficient structured generation. Besides JSON, you can "
"use an EBNF grammar to guide the generation, providing more flexibility "
"for customization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how_to/ebnf_guided_generation.rst:9
